**Important Considerations:**

*   **Variability:** The exact boundaries of the gamma band can be somewhat variable across studies and EEG systems.
*   **Individual Variability:** There some individual differences in the range of gamma frequencies observed.
*   **EEG System Limitations:** The capabilities of the EEG equipment used can also affect the ability to detect and define the full range of gamma oscillations.



